apital 的 Nadia Martin Wiggen 则在中东袭击升级之际审视石油市场。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/bloomberg-brief-11-27-2026-video'&gt;人工智能交易加速，股票期货上涨；欧盟预算谈判陷入困境&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stock Futures Rally as AI Trade Gathers Pace; EU Budget Talks Falter&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/bloomberg-brief-11-27-2026-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:20:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[金融时报] 市场动荡时要坚持的首要原则</title><link>https://www.ft.com/content/839c7d2c-adad-4e70-9abd-3cd5bdf5e09e?syn-25a6b1a6=1</link><description>如果您现在不知道该怎么做，请坚持投资基础知识&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/839c7d2c-adad-4e70-9abd-3cd5bdf5e09e?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;市场动荡时要坚持的首要原则&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：First principles to cling to when markets convulse&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ft.com/content/839c7d2c-adad-4e70-9abd-3cd5bdf5e09e?syn-25a6b1a6=1</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:32:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 欧洲风力过多，电网不足</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/europe-has-too-much-wind-not-enough-power-grid</link><description>非洲大陆增加可再生电力的速度快于输送电力所需的基础设施建设速度，导致消费者为此付出代价。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/europe-has-too-much-wind-not-enough-power-grid'&gt;欧洲风力过多，电网不足&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Europe Has Too Much Wind, Not Enough Power Grid&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/europe-has-too-much-wind-not-enough-power-grid</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:33:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNN] 泰森·福里的妻子澄清称他并未被诊断出患有精神分裂症</title><link>https://ne